  - title: Something for something
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Could you bring me some strawberries? Five. Good ones.
    - What for? Oh... for something. Just something. Never mind what for.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 659a557b27a1ae14b8e0d2ce904cbf15, type: 2}
      amount: 5
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Strawberries for something
      questText: Mi-sook wants five strawberries. She won't say what for.
      reminder:
      - The strawberries? Five, please. It's for... something. Stop smiling.
      thanks:
      - Beautiful. So red.
      - Now go, go. I have something to practise. I mean, to cook. To cook.
