  - title: The best ingredients
    number: 7
    heartsNeeded: 7
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - All right. All right! I'm going to cook something properly. My mother's recipe, but my way.
    - I need the best pumpkins you can grow. Not ordinary ones. Silver quality, at least. The kind that make you close your eyes.
    - Whatever I decide to do with the dish, it has to start with the best.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 71e8abaac063a7449a20032e0475b777, type: 2}
      amount: 3
      minQuality: 1
      questTitle: Mi-sook's best dish
      questText: Mi-sook needs three Silver-quality (or better) pumpkins for her mother's recipe. Fertilizer from the city improves crop quality.
      reminder:
      - Pumpkins, Silver quality or better. Three. I know it's a lot to ask. I'm asking anyway. See? I'm learning.
      thanks:
      - Oh. Oh, these are perfect.
      - My mother would have held one up to the light like this. Thank you.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Where should I cook it?
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The competition is next month. Sterling Foods is paying for it. The prize is a lot of money, and they put your dish in their shops.
    - Or... I had another idea. In my village, once a year, everybody brought a table into the street and we ate together. All of us.
    - One big dinner, here, in the plaza. Everybody brings one thing. And for once, I cook something for me and they all eat it.
    - Which one? Don't think. Just say.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Cook a street dinner
      replyA:
      - A street dinner. Yes. Yes!
      - I'm telling Rosa first. She'll bring bread. Then Frank will bring terrible sandwiches, and Gus will complain about them, and it will be perfect.
      flagsA:
      - street_dinner_planned
      optionB: Enter the competition
      replyB:
      - The competition. On television! Ji-ho will laugh at me.
      - Good. Let him laugh. I'll be the one on television.
      flagsB:
      - misook_competition
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Long tables
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Did you see the tables? From the fountain all the way to the slush machine!
    - Gus said Frank's sandwiches were the worst food he'd ever tasted, and then he ate four. Kenji brought tea. Tariq played until the street lamps came on.
    - And my pumpkin dish was gone before I even sat down. Everyone asked for the recipe. I said maybe. Maybe means yes, but slowly.
    happy: 1
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
